/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This article is about content that is <b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inaccessible\" title=\"Category:Inaccessible\">inaccessible</a> through normal gameplay</b>. It can still be accessed via in-game exploits or third party tools.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Thieves' Cant</b> is a hidden <a href=\"/wiki/Rogue\" title=\"Rogue\">Rogue</a> passive. This passive unlocks dialogue that is only avaible to rogues.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>During your rogue training you learned thieves' cant, a secret mix of dialect, jargon, and code that allows you to hide messages in seemingly normal conversation. Only another creature that knows thieves' cant understands such messages. In addition, you understand a set of secret signs and symbols used to convey short, simple messages, such as whether an area is dangerous or the territory of a thieves' guild, whether loot is nearby, or whether the people in an area are easy marks or will provide a safe house for thieves on the run. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Classes:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Rogue\" title=\"Rogue\">Rogue</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715070737\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 497/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4275/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1635/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1601/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 880301/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.935      1 -total\n 57.17%   23.976      1 Template:Inaccessible\n 56.32%   23.618      1 Template:Inaccessible/internal\n 54.58%   22.890      1 Template:Ambox\n 42.74%   17.922      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n  9.94%    4.168      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n  9.81%    4.112      1 Template:PageSeo\n  9.13%    3.829      1 Template:Hidden_code\n  8.54%    3.581      2 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  4.37%    1.832      3 Template:IfEmpty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:47657-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715070737 and revision id 244311. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}